<h3><u>Ay Fatima Sughra Ghar Lut Gaya Beta</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p dir="ltr">Watan mei ehle haram ka jo kafela pahocha<br />
Basheer karta tha sar apna peet ke nauha<br />
Madine walo nabi ka ujad gaya kunba<br />
Fakat hai mardo mei baki janabe zainul aba</p>

<p dir="ltr">Nabi ke roze pe wojh sabse pehle jayege<br />
Vahi pe hale safar apna woh sunayenge</p>

<p dir="ltr">Madine walo ne jis dum suni yeh gum ki khabar<br />
Bukao sina zani se bapa hua mehshaar<br />
Asa sambhale huey ek bibi pit ti thi sar<br />
Nabi ke roze pe jaati thi kehti hai padar</p>

<p dir="ltr">Aarey Karib nakoke pahochi jo fatema sughra<br />
To usne nalao shewan mei apna naam suna</p>

<p dir="ltr">Aye fatema sughra ghar lot gaya beta x 2</p>

<p dir="ltr">Kya dhondti hai haal pareshan dulari<br />
Baba ki tere aaiyi nahi firqe sawari<br />
Bhayya ali akbar bhi tera aya na pyaari<br />
Sau bar phuphi ho tei muzloomi pe wari<br />
Mein deti ho pursa</p>

<p dir="ltr">Mei tujko sunati hu wh sab haal safar ka<br />
Pardes mein kis tarha luta gulshane zehra<br />
Sar nange gaya kis tarha bazar mein kunba<br />
Darbare sitamgar ka aur qaid ka kissa<br />
Sun aai mei dukhiya</p>

<p dir="ltr">Jis waqt hua barchi tokde dile akbar<br />
Aankhon mein basharat na rahi shah ke dilbar</p>

<p dir="ltr">Laashon ko uthane gaye ishal mein sarwar<br />
Girte the harek laash pe akbar ki samajhkar<br />
Milta na tha laasha</p>

<p dir="ltr">Shabbir ne jab laasha e farzand ko paya<br />
Khechi jo sina sath kaleja nikal aaya<br />
Mayyat ko jawan bete ki phir jhukke uthaya<br />
Lakar use maidan se khaime mein litaya<br />
Ek hasr tha barpa</p>

<p dir="ltr">Tu dhondti hai jiski har ek god mein dilgir<br />
Che mah le asgar ki nahi thi koi taqsir<br />
Mara bine kahil ne tere bhai ko ek tir<br />
Khoon muh se ugal kar hua be jaano besheer<br />
Khali hua jula</p>

<p dir="ltr">Shaadi hui kasim ki magar ras na aayi<br />
Ek raat suhagan rahi bewa huwi kubra<br />
Pamal kiya zalimo ne dulhe ka laasha<br />
Maqkat mein tane jane hasan bikhra pada tha<br />
In ankhone dekha</p>

<p dir="ltr">Uf tashnagi bachcho ki jo pate teh nahi chain<br />
Aati thi sadaey alatash aur kabhi bain<br />
Jab hadse sheeva dekha jo atfal ko bechain<br />
Pani gaya bharne pisare sayyede kunain<br />
Mara gaya saqqa</p>

<p dir="ltr">Kamsim bhi the pyase bhi the woh dono dulare<br />
Lekin jo gaye ladte woh darya ke kinare<br />
Kuch gham nahi jo aun o muhammed gaye mare<br />
Pehle hi the woh bhai ke sadke me uthare</p>

<p dir="ltr">Baad jiske aya aya karbobal mei hua mehshar<br />
Shabbir ki gardan pe chala zulm ka khanjar<br />
Khhaime bhi jalaye gaye aur chin gayi chadar<br />
Na mehramoka majma tha aur the khole sar<br />
Har lamha thi eza</p>

<p dir="ltr">Bachcho ke gale bazu hamare gaye bandhe<br />
Kuch unt liye itne mein aada wahan aaye<br />
Un nako pe bithlaya na tha jinke kajave<br />
Thi gyarah moharram jo chale karbobala se<br />
Din raat safar ka</p>

<p dir="ltr">Kis tarha sunao mein safar ka tuje ehwaal<br />
Chehre ko chupaye hue the bibiyo ke baal<br />
Is jabr tash shadat se safar ka tha bura haal<br />
Kuch jism ke hisso se juda ho gayi thi khaal<br />
Woh dekhengi beta</p>

<p dir="ltr">Sab bibiyon ke haath pashe pushte bandhe the<br />
Mao ke bajae the pisar maao ko pakde<br />
Rafta ki tezi se sambhal pae na bachche<br />
Chausat mare masoom gaye nako se kuchle<br />
Yeh taza alam tha</p>

<p dir="ltr">Darbar yazide mein gaye phir hame lekar<br />
Bithlaye the woh kursi nasshi satsa lakar<br />
Jakde hue rassi se the sab aur khule sar<br />
Phut jata hai dil karti hu jab yaad woh manzar<br />
Kya waqt kathin tha</p>

<p dir="ltr">Darbar se le jake rakha kaide sitam mei<br />
Paya na sukan wahan bhi wafa huan gum mein<br />
Ghut ghut ke sakina mari zindane sitam mein<br />
Ek bar qayamat hui phir ehle haram mein<br />
Lasha bhi na uththa</p>

<p dir="ltr">Zindan hi mein nanhi si kabr ek banayi<br />
Dafna di khasad zabr wahan banu ki jaayi<br />
Hum sabko diya zalimone hukme rehaayi<br />
Markar bhi rehai na mayassar use aayi<br />
Woh reh gaayi tanha</p>

<p dir="ltr">Zindan ke darwaze pe jab ayi amari<br />
Sar pitke ye bono e nashaad pukari<br />
Bar ayi tamannae dili aab teri pyaari<br />
Uth chalo ghar jate hai aye dard ki maari<br />
Shak hota tha sina</p>

<p dir="ltr">Ma dek rahi pitke sar apna duhai<br />
Thi shor bahut bibiyo ke dil pe judaai<br />
Lekin hui markadse sakina ke judaai<br />
Phir shaam ke zindaan se sare karbala aayi<br />
Phatta tha kaleja<br />
Jab bibiyo ko ganje shaheeda nazar aaya<br />
Nake se kareb bibi ne apne ko giraya</p>

<p dir="ltr">Nazro mein tha ashur ka manzar jo samaya<br />
Bus dekhte hi muh se kaleja nikal aaya<br />
Har labpe tha nauha</p>

<p dir="ltr">Sajjad ne dafnadiya jab lashe bahattar<br />
Ansoro azizo ka kiya chehlome asgar<br />
Abbas ka kasim ka chehlome akbar<br />
Us alamme gurbat mein kiya chehlome sarwar<br />
Kuch paas nahi tha</p>

<p dir="ltr">Sughra ne suni zainae muztar se ye rudad<br />
Chera na raha zaptka gash ho gaayi nashaad<br />
Us waqt anees ehle haram ne jo ki fariyad<br />
Hosh apne gawa baitha waha jitne the aabad<br />
Sab karte the nala</p>

<p dir="ltr">Aye fatema sughra ghar lot gaya beta</p>
</p>  